id: pm-cg1sjb
title: "SDK entrypoint import-cost gate false-fails on cold filesystem cache: single-shot fresh-process sampling exceeds the 30ms noise margin"
description: "Live reproduction 2026-07-26 on clean main (2026.7.26): the first pnpm lint invocation of the day failed the SDK entrypoint import-cost gate with './sdk/runtime: 545ms > 510ms' (budget 480ms + LATENCY_NOISE_MARGIN_MS 30). An immediate re-run with zero code or environment changes passed all 10 entrypoints, and every subsequent run stayed green. The gate spawns fresh Node processes per entrypoint but takes a single timing sample per check run, so a cold filesystem/module cache on the first run of a session (or a loaded CI runner) converts pure measurement noise into a hard gate failure. False failures train agents to re-run gates until green and erode trust in the pipeline — the symmetric hazard to the false-pass erosion pm-k6t4yb registers. Duplicate check: searched import-cost/noise/cold/flake all-status; pm-38bskj (closed) shaped the entrypoints, pm-ag9nka owns --profile truthfulness, pm-k6t4yb owns the gate registry and negative controls — none own per-run sampling noise of this gate. Fix directions (implementation out of scope for the filing pass): warm-up sample discarded before measurement, min-of-N sampling per entrypoint instead of single-shot, or cache-aware margin; whichever lands must register in the pm-k6t4yb gate registry with a negative-control fixture."
type: Issue
status: closed
priority: 2
tags[4]: "area:ci",flake,gate-reliability,performance
created_at: "2026-07-26T10:28:46.495Z"
updated_at: "2026-08-12T02:34:16.221Z"
closed_at: "2026-08-12T02:34:15.523Z"
completed_at: "2026-08-12T02:34:15.523Z"
author: "harness:opencode"
estimated_minutes: 120
acceptance_criteria: "The import-cost gate cannot fail solely because the first sampled process hit a cold cache: measurement uses either a discarded warm-up sample or min-of-N per entrypoint; a simulated cold-cache run is green when costs are within budget; the gate still fails on a genuinely over-budget entrypoint (negative control per pm-k6t4yb); budgets in scripts/bench/sdk-entrypoint-budgets.json are not raised to absorb noise"
parent: pm-u9d0
risk: low
confidence: high
severity: low
resolution: SDK entrypoint import cost admission is resilient to isolated scheduler or cache outliers while still failing a majority persistent slowdown against unchanged budgets.
expected_result: A single noisy process cannot fail the gate; genuinely over-budget repeated samples still fail and RSS remains fail-closed.
actual_result: The five-sample median policy and negative controls merged in 17b40763f; merged-head benchmark and CI workflows passed.
